cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, data or text, please cite it as below."
title: "An Agent-Based Model for the Social Collapse of Calhoun's Universe 25 Experiment"
abstract: >-
  Code, simulation outputs and manuscripts of a minimal agent-based model that reproduces,
  qualitatively, the observations of J. B. Calhoun's Universe 25 experiment (1973): growth,
  stagnation, social withdrawal ("beautiful ones") and extinction with unlimited resources.
type: software
authors:
